/-
  OIBridge/LieRankSource.lean — the primitive-source audit, fourth target: the Lie-rank clause
  of reversible richness, audited for redundancy and derived from elementary transitions.

  ROUND FIFTY-NINE. After round fifty-eight the carrier-general quantum-complete package is
  reversible implementation locality, Lie-rank richness and embedded observation, and the
  Lie-rank clause is the one substantive selector with no audited source. The round follows
  the audit's discipline: redundancy first, then the source.

  A. THE REDUNDANCY TEST FAILS. Implementation classes closed under the operations every
  finite operational theory performs — identity, product, scalar, ancilla projector, ancilla
  block — GENERATE a finite operational theory on every carrier (`Architecture`,
  `genTheory`): availability is realization by the class with the aggregate trace preserved.
  The generated theories form a regrouping-invariant family, relabelling-invariant when the
  class is (`genFamily`), so the generated theory carries embedded observation
  (`genTheory_embeddedObservation`); it is generated by its class definitionally, so with a
  context-stable, label-invariant, dagger-stable class it carries reversible implementation
  locality (`genTheory_reversibleImplementationLocality`). The DIAGONAL class — operators
  with no off-diagonal entry — is such an architecture (`diagClass`, `diagClass_arch`,
  and the three stability properties). Its generated theory on the qubit has no composite
  unitary control: every available conjugation is realized by diagonal operators, hence
  preserves diagonal matrices, and the round-42 rotation `rot` does not
  (`diagGen_not_control`). Since the inverse clause holds there (dagger stability) and
  inverse accessibility with Lie-rank richness gives control (`control_of_lieRank_inverse`),
  Lie-rank richness fails: `lieRank_not_redundant`. Reversible implementation locality and
  embedded observation do not supply the Lie-rank clause.

  B. THE PRIMITIVE, IN ELEMENTARY IMPLEMENTATIONS. At every level and for every two
  distinguishable states `a ≠ b`: the real transition generator `X_ab = E_ab + E_ba` is
  continuously drivable (its flow is available for every time); the exchange of `a` and `b`
  is available (the transposition, a permutation matrix); and a quarter phase on `a` is
  available (`ElementaryTransitionRichness`, with `transition`, `permMatrix`, `phaseGate`).
  Nothing in it mentions a Lie algebra, a drift/control certificate, or reachability.

  C. THE DERIVATION, FINITE LIE ALGEBRA. Fix a base state `i₀` and one partner `j₁`. Take the
  drift `X_{i₀j₁}` and as controls the words `P_σ · S_{i₀}^b` (a permutation matrix times an
  optional quarter phase), all available as words in exchanges and the phase. Conjugating
  the drift by a permutation carries `X_{i₀j₁}` to `X_{σi₀,σj₁}`, and by the quarter phase to
  `Y_{i₀j₁} = i(E_{i₀j₁} − E_{j₁i₀})`; since a permutation carries any ordered pair of
  distinct states to any other, the control Lie algebra contains `−iX_pq` and `−iY_pq` for
  every `p ≠ q` (`perm_conj_transition`, `phase_conj_transition`, `exists_perm_pair`).
  The bracket `[−iX_pq, −iY_pq] = 2i(E_pp − E_qq)` supplies the diagonal directions
  (`bracket_XY`). Every traceless skew-Hermitian matrix is a real combination of these
  (`pair_decomp`, `specialSkew_mem`), so `su(D)` lies in the control Lie algebra
  (`hControl_star`) and Lie-rank richness follows (`lieRank_of_elementary`). The
  derivation consumes one driven transition, one quarter phase and the exchanges; the
  primitive grants more, and its minimal form is not settled here.

  NECESSITY. Full composite unitary control supplies every elementary transition
  (`elementary_of_control`), so exact finite operational QM has the primitive.

  THE COMPRESSED SET. `OIPlusElem` is reversible implementation locality, elementary
  transition richness and embedded observation; `carrier_general_oiPlusElem` proves it
  equivalent to exact finite endomorphic operational QM on every nonempty finite carrier.
  Every principle in it is now stated at the level of implementations or of the observer
  architecture; none is a Lie-algebraic or reachability condition.

  WHAT IS NOT CLAIMED. The minimal elementary repertoire (whether the phase is dispensable
  on three or more states, whether one driven pair and one exchange orbit suffice) is not
  settled. The converse from Lie-rank richness to elementary transition richness is not
  claimed. Nothing here bears on the open redundancy of the inverse clause.
-/

